## 25. SECURITY

### 25.1 Authentication

- **Provider:** Supabase Auth — Email/Password cho admin
- **Session:** Cookie-based (httpOnly, Secure, SameSite=Lax)
- **Token refresh:** Tự động qua Supabase client
- **Admin routes:** Middleware kiểm tra session trước khi render
- **Multiple failed logins:** Rate limit 5 attempts / 15 phút → lockout

### 25.2 Authorization

- **Row Level Security (RLS):** Bật trên mọi table trong Supabase
- **RLS Policies:**
  ```sql
  -- products: public read, admin write
  CREATE POLICY "Products are publicly readable"
    ON products FOR SELECT USING (status = 'published');
  
  CREATE POLICY "Admin can manage products"
    ON products FOR ALL USING (
      auth.uid() IN (SELECT id FROM profiles WHERE role IN ('admin', 'super_admin'))
    );
  ```
- **Server Actions:** Kiểm tra role đầu mỗi action (không tin client-side auth check)
- **API Routes:** Verify JWT token từ header/cookie

### 25.3 Input Validation & Sanitization

- **Zod:** Validate tất cả input từ form và API
- **HTML sanitization:** Dùng `DOMPurify` hoặc `sanitize-html` trước khi lưu rich text
- **File upload:**
  - Chỉ cho phép: JPEG, PNG, WebP, PDF
  - Max size: 5MB cho ảnh, 20MB cho PDF
  - Kiểm tra MIME type thực (không chỉ extension)
  - Rename file khi upload (UUID + extension)
- **SQL Injection:** Không xảy ra vì dùng Supabase client (parameterized queries)

### 25.4 XSS Prevention

- Next.js escape HTML mặc định
- Chỉ dùng `dangerouslySetInnerHTML` cho rich text đã sanitize
- Content Security Policy (CSP) header:
  ```
  default-src 'self';
  script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' (chỉ vì Next.js);
  style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' fonts.googleapis.com;
  img-src 'self' data: [supabase-project-url] *.supabase.co;
  connect-src 'self' *.supabase.co *.anthropic.com;
  ```

### 25.5 Environment Variables

```
Phân loại:
NEXT_PUBLIC_*    → Expose to client (URL, public keys)
                   NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL
                   NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY

Private (server only):
                   SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY
                   ANTHROPIC_API_KEY
                   RESEND_API_KEY (email)
```

- Service role key KHÔNG BAO GIỜ dùng phía client
- `.env.local` trong `.gitignore`
- Vercel: Lưu sensitive keys trong Environment Variables

### 25.6 Rate Limiting

- AI Chat: 10 requests/min/IP
- Lead form: 3 submissions/10 min/IP
- Auth: 5 failed attempts/15 min
- Thực hiện qua Vercel Edge Middleware + Upstash Redis (nếu cần)

### 25.7 Dependency Security

- `npm audit` trong CI pipeline
- Dependabot alerts enabled
- Không dùng unmaintained packages

