## 26. PERFORMANCE OPTIMIZATION

### 26.1 Core Web Vitals Targets

| Metric | Target | Measurement |
|---|---|---|
| LCP (Largest Contentful Paint) | < 2.5s | Google Search Console |
| INP (Interaction to Next Paint) | < 200ms | CrUX report |
| CLS (Cumulative Layout Shift) | < 0.1 | Lighthouse |
| FCP (First Contentful Paint) | < 1.8s | Lighthouse |
| TTFB (Time to First Byte) | < 600ms | WebPageTest |

### 26.2 Image Optimization

- `next/image` với auto-optimization (WebP, AVIF conversion, lazy loading)
- `sizes` attribute chính xác cho từng context
- Hero image: `priority={true}`, preload hint
- Lazy load tất cả ảnh below the fold
- Supabase Storage: Transform API cho responsive images
  ```
  ?width=800&quality=80&format=webp
  ```
- Alt text bắt buộc cho mọi ảnh (SEO + Accessibility)
- Placeholder blur (`blurDataURL`) cho ảnh từ Supabase

### 26.3 JavaScript Optimization

- Tree-shaking: Import specific từ library, không import cả thư viện
  ```typescript
  import { format } from 'date-fns/format'  // ✅
  import * as dateFns from 'date-fns'        // ❌
  ```
- Code splitting: Next.js tự động, thêm `dynamic()` cho heavy components
  - Rich text editor → dynamic import
  - Image lightbox → dynamic import
  - Chart.js (nếu dùng) → dynamic import
- Bundle analyzer: `@next/bundle-analyzer` để kiểm tra

### 26.4 Caching Strategy

```
Static assets (JS/CSS): max-age=31536000, immutable (Next.js default)
Images từ Supabase: Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400
ISR pages: stale-while-revalidate theo revalidate config
API routes: Tùy endpoint, no-cache cho dynamic data
```

### 26.5 Font Optimization

```typescript
// next/font (tự host, zero layout shift)
import { Playfair_Display, Inter } from 'next/font/google'

const playfair = Playfair_Display({
  subsets: ['latin', 'vietnamese'],
  display: 'swap',
  variable: '--font-display',
})
```

- `display: swap` để tránh FOIT
- Chỉ load weights cần thiết (400, 600, 700)
- `preload: true` cho font dùng above the fold

### 26.6 Database Query Optimization

- Index tất cả foreign keys và columns dùng trong WHERE/ORDER BY
- Pagination qua `LIMIT/OFFSET` hoặc cursor-based (cho table lớn)
- Full-text search: `search_vector` column với `GIN index`
- `SELECT` chỉ columns cần thiết (không `SELECT *`)
- Views hoặc materialized views cho dashboard stats phức tạp

### 26.7 Third-party Scripts

- Google Analytics / Tag Manager: Load async, sau `window.onload`
- Chat widget: Deferred load (load sau 3s hoặc sau user interaction)
- Facebook Pixel (nếu có): Async, noscript fallback
- Zalo OA SDK: Async

