## 28. DEPLOYMENT STRATEGY

### 28.1 Environments

| Environment | Branch | URL | Purpose |
|---|---|---|---|
| Development | local | localhost:3000 | Phát triển local |
| Staging | `develop` | staging.domain.com | QA, test trước production |
| Production | `main` | domain.com | Live |

### 28.2 Vercel Setup

- **Framework:** Next.js (auto-detected)
- **Build command:** `next build`
- **Output:** Standalone (`.next`)
- **Root directory:** `/` (hoặc `apps/web` nếu monorepo)
- **Environment variables:** Cấu hình trong Vercel Dashboard per environment
- **Domains:** Custom domain với SSL tự động

### 28.3 CI/CD Pipeline

```yaml
# Trigger on PR và push to main
1. Lint (ESLint + Prettier check)
2. Type check (tsc --noEmit)
3. Unit tests (vitest)
4. Build (next build)
5. Deploy to Staging (Vercel preview)
6. E2E smoke test (Playwright — chỉ trang chủ, form báo giá)
7. Manual approval → Deploy to Production
```

### 28.4 Database Migrations

- Migration files đặt trong `supabase/migrations/`
- Chạy qua Supabase CLI: `supabase db push`
- Không bao giờ sửa migration đã chạy — tạo migration mới
- Seed data cho staging: `supabase/seed.sql`

### 28.5 Vercel Edge Network

- Static assets: CDN auto (Vercel)
- ISR pages: Edge caching, revalidate on-demand qua `revalidatePath()`
- Image Optimization: Vercel's built-in (nếu không dùng Supabase Transform)

### 28.6 Monitoring

- **Vercel Analytics:** Core Web Vitals real-user monitoring
- **Vercel Logs:** Runtime errors, function logs
- **Supabase Dashboard:** Query performance, connection pool
- **Uptime:** Better Uptime hoặc UptimeRobot (ping mỗi 5 phút)
- **Error tracking:** Sentry (production only)

### 28.7 Backup Strategy

- Supabase: Automatic daily backups (Point-in-time recovery trên Pro plan)
- Supabase Storage: Files trong S3-compatible storage (replicated)
- Code: GitHub (remote backup)

